  "timing_and_race": "Default timer is 90% of one hour after the observed request; TTL must be 1h, context at least 200000 tokens by default (floor 100000), no busy work or pending user input, no unsuitable rate limit or stale deadline. onIdle and fire both check. Prompt, steer, cancel and model change disarm a pending timer; teardown disposes it. After fire starts compact(), disarm alone does not abort that async work; teardown separately cancels and joins queued turns. No race outcome is inferred without the exact executed upstream proof."
